   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&|\\vec c|^2=|\\vec a|^2+2\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b+|\\vec b|^2\\\\[5pt]&\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=ab\\cos(180^\\circ-\\gamma)=-ab\\cos\\gamma\\\\[5pt]&c^2=a^2+b^2-2ab\\cos\\gamma\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
